%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H10_X1_1_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: I keep close to further eavesdrop on their conversation.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He has been transported according to plan a few weeks ago, we have not
      heard any news on him since.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c86454fd71fe4258bbe97dd2023a6898, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What do you mean, you have not heard any news? Have I not clearly ordered
      you to closely watch over him, especially at the start of this next phase?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "What do they mean by \u201Cnext phase\u201D? It sounds like they have
      some sort of master plan to take over the world or something."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "W\u2014 well yes sir, we didn't think we would commence this soon already.
      We will get back to closer surveillance immediately then."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c86454fd71fe4258bbe97dd2023a6898, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, I would hope so. Incredible, what an incompetent bunch you all are.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I am deeply sorry, sir. We\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c86454fd71fe4258bbe97dd2023a6898, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Shut your mouth!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "This \u201Csir\u201D guy does not seem that nice."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Something is off\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Wha\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c86454fd71fe4258bbe97dd2023a6898, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What did I tell you? Quiet! I am perceiving something.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: A shiver runs down my spine. My hand is still placed on the strange wall.
      I notice something weird about it though.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It's freezing cold.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try separating it from the smooth sheet, but it won't budge. It feels
      as if my fingertips mended into one with parts of it. I'm stuck.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Another presence is\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "In that moment I get yanked forward. Before I can comprehend what is happening,
      my head makes contact with the barrier and\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c017f2dc9f1c531439bd28453439c861, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 865b7212068540ccb4933bedb7bc71f6, type: 2}
